    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Hypervigilance.</strong> Whenever you roll Initiative, you can reroll the d20 if it shows a 9 or lower, and you must use the new roll.</p><p><strong>Steel Yourself.</strong> When you fail a saving throw to avoid or end the Charmed or Frightened condition, you can take a Reaction to add a bonus equal to your Proficiency Bonus to the roll, potentially turning it into a success. Once you take this Reaction, you can’t do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-rwYvb0z9Dn7DSK7Y\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Reroll an Initiative of 9 or lower yourself. <em>Steel Yourself</em> rolls the bonus to add to the failed save.</p></section>",
